OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny spells and a
OL,6,Fscattering of afternoon showers. Some
OL,7,Fof the showers will be heavy, with the
OL,8,Frisk of hail and thunder. Not
OL,9,Feverywhere will see these and will
OL,10,Fstay dry. Feeling very warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSunny spells through the
OL,14,Fevening, but a few heavy showers
OL,15,Fremain possible. Mostly dry overnight,
OL,16,Fwith any showers tending to fade as we
OL,17,Fhead towards dawn. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
